					<tr>
						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														If you plan on trying the xegony server, allow me to welcome you. My guild the RING OF FATE is currently about 70 members strong. We do not look to be the most powerful guild on the xegony server, rather the closest guild. We at times have open enrollment which means any level can join, but usually do restrict to members level 25 and us. We do require that you have a sponsor. Meaning that you have hunted with a member already in guild who will speak on your behalf. Our guild searches for quality - not quantity. We are perfectly happy with the size of guild we have. We promote guild grouping. Which means we like to do things together. We do alot of &quot;prep raids&quot; for mid and upper level members so that they know what to expect when it comes times to go to the planes. We take care of our own. We have a guild treasury that we allow members to borrow from until they aquire better items or equipment. We are a guild thet treats eachother like family. We expect nothing less than respect in return for the respect we show others. We like to remember that everquest is a game for entertainment. That means we dont have a lot of rules. We like to take it easy and have fun. We dont make mandatory raids or pressure you to level. All we ask is that you help one another like family should. If you may be interested in our guild feel free to send me a tell in game, or speak to any of our members. Be Safe and happy hunting.<br />
~Azna<br />
Level 52 half elf Druid						</td>
